WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You make a choice. The result comes back different.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 2005, experimenters switched the selected face.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some participants gave reasons for the face they received.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But silence might not mean the switch went unnoticed.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A 2025 study found signs of detection without a report.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Evidence first. A good story is not proof of a product.
